(CORVANE SYSTEMS - ACCESS CONTROL STANDARD CS-AC-01) Tj T*
(Revision B. Approved March 2024.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 Sessions) Tj T*
(At AL1, the inactivity timeout SHALL be no more than 4 hours.) Tj T*
(At AL2, reauthentication SHALL occur after 1 hour of inactivity.) Tj T*
(At AL2, the overall session timeout SHALL be no more than 12 hours, after which) Tj T*
(reauthentication is required.) Tj T*
(Page 3) Tj T*
ET
